{"t":"NVDA","made":"2026-11-06 14:38","name":"NVIDIA Corporation","ko":"엔비디아","sector":"Technology","industry":"Semiconductors","employees":42000,"hq":"Santa Clara, CA, United States","website":"https://www.nvidia.com","summary_en":"NVIDIA Corporation operates as a data center scale AI infrastructure company in the United States, Taiwan, China, Hong Kong, Europe, and internationally. It operates through Compute & Networking, and Graphics segments. The Compute & Networking segment provides data center accelerated computing and networking platforms and artificial intelligence solutions and software, and automotive platforms and autonomous and electric vehicle solutions, including software. The Graphics segment offers GeForce GPUs for gaming and PCs; Quadro/NVIDIA RTX GPUs for enterprise workstation graphics. The company's products are used in gaming, professional visualization, data center, and automotive markets. It sells its products to original equipment manufacturers, original device manufacturers, system integrators and distributors, independent software vendors, cloud service providers, add-in board manufacturers, distributors, automotive manufacturers and tier-1 automotive suppliers, and other ecosystem participants. It has a collaboration with Cisco to develop Ultra-Dense Small Form Factor Pluggable (USFP), a high-density optical module pluggable transceiver. It has a collaboration with ChipAgents to develop Build-A-Chip-Bench, a benchmark for AI agents carrying chip design tasks and The Company has a strategic alliance with MediaTek to build the next generations of AI computing platforms. NVIDIA Corporation was incorporated in 1993 and is headquartered in Santa Clara, California.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"NVIDIA Corporation은 미국, 대만, 중국, 홍콩, 유럽 및 전 세계에서 데이터 센터 규모의 AI 인프라 회사로 운영되고 있습니다. 컴퓨팅 및 네트워킹, 그래픽 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 컴퓨팅 및 네트워킹 부문은 데이터 센터 가속 컴퓨팅 및 네트워킹 플랫폼, 인공 지능 솔루션 및 소프트웨어, 자동차 플랫폼, 소프트웨어를 포함한 자율 및 전기 자동차 솔루션을 제공합니다. 그래픽 부문에서는 게임 및 PC용 GeForce GPU를 제공합니다. 엔터프라이즈 워크스테이션 그래픽을 위한 Quadro/NVIDIA RTX GPU. 이 회사의 제품은 게임, 전문 시각화, 데이터 센터 및 자동차 시장에서 사용됩니다. OEM은 OEM, OEM, 시스템 통합업체 및 유통업체, 독립 소프트웨어 공급업체, 클라우드 서비스 제공업체, 애드인 보드 제조업체, 유통업체, 자동차 제조업체, 1차 자동차 공급업체, 기타 생태계 참가자에게 제품을 판매합니다. Cisco와 협력하여 고밀도 광 모듈 플러그형 트랜시버인 USFP(Ultra-Dense Small Form Factor Pluggable)를 개발했습니다. ChipAgents와 협력하여 칩 설계 작업을 수행하는 AI 에이전트의 벤치마크인 Build-A-Chip-Bench를 개발하고 있으며, 회사는 차세대 AI 컴퓨팅 플랫폼을 구축하기 위해 MediaTek과 전략적 제휴를 맺고 있습니다. NVIDIA Corporation은 1993년에 설립되었으며 캘리포니아주 산타클라라에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":181.6,"mcap":4385095286784.0,"pe":22.958282,"fpe":11.410906,"peg":0.2434,"ps":14.473694,"pb":19.150059,"ev_ebitda":21.628,"div":0.55,"beta":2.247,"hi52":243.37,"lo52":164.27},"fin":{"rev":302970011648.0,"rev_g":1.059,"eps_g":1.278,"gross":0.74674004,"op":0.66236997,"net":0.63663,"roe":1.17211,"fcf":41809874944.0,"cash":62469001216.0,"debt":38860001280.0,"de":16.971,"eps":7.91,"feps":15.9146},"own":{"short":0.012999999,"inst":0.71472,"insider":0.04007},"analyst":{"n":58,"mean":327.1431,"median":315.0,"high":515.0,"low":180.0,"rec":"strong_buy","recMean":1.29032,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":10,"buy":49,"hold":2,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":10,"buy":49,"hold":2,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":10,"buy":49,"hold":2,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":9,"buy":48,"hold":2,"sell":1,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"Melius Research","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":315.0,"priorPriceTarget":420.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-22","Firm":"Needham","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"reit","priceTargetAction":"Maintains","currentPriceTarget":300.0,"priorPriceTarget":300.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-01","Firm":"Cantor Fitzgerald","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"reit","priceTargetAction":"Maintains","currentPriceTarget":350.0,"priorPriceTarget"